, {"type": "target_word_describer", "contents": [{"type": "text", "content": " These are words you use to talk about cultures."}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "lime"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "a small, green citrus fruit"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: The Mexican people like to put lime juice and red chili spice on fruit."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn5le01ob05aud02"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "bought"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "the verb to buy in the Simple Past tense "}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(verb)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: I bought cooked food and fruits from street vendors.  "}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn5le01ob05aud03"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "generous"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "describes a person who gives things willingly"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(adjective)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: The street vendor was a generous man. "}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn5le01ob05aud04"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "warm"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "describes a person who smiles and gives positive energy"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(adjective)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: My colleague is a warm man. "}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn5le01ob05aud05"}]}, {"type": "takeaway_extension", "contents": [{"type": "text", "content": "Ask 5 friends or family members to tell funny anecdotes. It can be in your first language."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Choose the best anecdote -- the one you think is the most interesting or funny."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Write the anecdote in English. Use lots of details."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Read the anecdote to your partner."}]}, {"type": "takeaway_as